# ── Not for a public repository ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# Manuscript under review + confidential peer-review correspondence. Co-authored,
# so not ours alone to publish, and journals treat leaking review material as a
# breach. Keep local.
docs/

# Source PDFs for the benchmark papers: 12 of 13 are paywalled.
rag_benchmarking/additional_ingestation_papers/

# Python virtualenv for the ragas scoring stage (~600 MB).
rag_benchmarking/.venv-ragas/

# Run files embed every retrieved chunk verbatim (1.4 MB from paywalled
# sources). Publish runs_public/ instead — same records, chunk bodies removed.
rag_benchmarking/runs/

# Large generated artefacts and logs
output/extraction_checkpoint.json
output/*.log
rag_benchmarking/results/*.ragas.csv
*.prerepair
*.bak

# Ground-truth spreadsheets and the working dataset: the verbatim_passage /
# reference_contexts fields are text copied out of the source papers, most of
# which are paywalled. Published instead: data/ground_truth_public.jsonl and
# runs_public/, which keep the questions, the paraphrased ideal answers, the
# numeric gold values, strata, DOIs and every score, with the copied text removed.
rag_benchmarking/ground_truth_final.xlsx
rag_benchmarking/ground_truth_template_updated.xlsx
rag_benchmarking/data/ground_truth.jsonl
rag_benchmarking/ground_truth_paloma_20260926.xlsx
rag_benchmarking/ground_truth_template_blank.xlsx

